{"4199480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Outlanders - Exiles of Veridion", "steam_appid": 4199480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OUTLANDERS</strong> - Exiles of Veridion is a sci-fi cooperative survival game set on a massive, fully procedural world. <br>You play as an <strong>inmate exiled to Veridion Prime</strong>, forced by UNC into a deadly survival experiment. Your only path to freedom is to stay alive long enough to rise above the system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OUTLANDERS BACKSTORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an inmate. Branded expendable and shipped across the stars aboard a massive prison transport, your destination is Veridion Prime, a hostile frontier world rich in Pentoxyd crystals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pentoxyd is the backbone of interstellar civilization. These volatile crystals power faster than light travel, deep space reactors, and advanced military tech. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entire empires rise and fall on Pentoxyd supply, and Veridion Prime is one of the last untapped sources left. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mining it is dangerous, deadly, and cheap only if the workers are prisoners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before arrival, disaster strikes. A massive explosion tears through the inmate transport ship. Alarms scream. Hulls rupture. In the chaos, you escape in a damaged pod and crash onto the surface of Veridion Prime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The planet is unstable, scarred by abandoned mining operations, hostile creatures, and the lingering presence of corporations that value crystals more than lives. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Mining is no longer just labor, it is survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build. Craft. Defend yourself. Explore forgotten facilities and uncover what really happened on Veridion Prime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were sent here to work until death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VERIDION PRIME – A FULLY PROCEDURAL WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every world is freshly generated: unique biomes, dynamic weather, abandoned structures, dangerous wildlife, UNC ruins, and shifting resources.<br>No run will ever play the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your base, expand your territory, and adapt before the planet adapts to you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BECOME AN OUTLANDER – FEARED SURVIVORS OF THE WASTES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive long enough and you will eventually <strong>become an Outlander</strong> – a highly dangerous, rogue inmate marked by UNC as a high-threat fugitive.<br>Outlanders are feared survivors who raid supply lines, attack outposts, and dominate the wild zones.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt or eliminate rival Outlanders to <strong>gain trust and reputation</strong> among colonists and traders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reputation unlocks merchants, missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware: becoming an Outlander also paints a target on your back.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BASE ATTACKS – STARTING AT LEVEL 10</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At level 10, UNC begins sending strike forces to eradicate your settlement.<br><strong>Base attacks start in waves</strong>, escalating every 5 levels.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extend the attack timer by paying taxes at the Trading Center</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock <strong>Defense Turrets</strong> at level 15</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage turret ammo via the <strong>Defense Turret Controller</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build strong, prepare your defenses, and hold the line.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COOPERATIVE STEAM MULTIPLAYER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends through Steam and survive together.<br>Share roles, build massive bases, explore dangerous zones, and defend each other against UNC forces and hostile wildlife.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEDICATED SERVERS – COMING LATER IN DEVELOPMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game evolves, <strong>dedicated server support</strong> will be introduced.<br>Persistent worlds. Large communities. 24/7 survival environments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong></strong><br><strong></strong><br><br><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully procedural maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harsh survival &amp; exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complex base-building</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base attacks starting at level 10</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced AI UNC soldiers &amp; native creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt Outlanders for <strong>trust and reputation</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam co-op for 2–8 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting, weapons, gear, technology</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather &amp; persistent progression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive. Build. Hunt. Become an Outlander.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OUTLANDERS</strong> - Exiles of Veridion is a sci-fi cooperative survival game set on a massive, fully procedural world. <br>You play as an <strong>inmate exiled to Veridion Prime</strong>, forced by UNC into a deadly survival experiment. Your only path to freedom is to stay alive long enough to rise above the system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OUTLANDERS BACKSTORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an inmate. Branded expendable and shipped across the stars aboard a massive prison transport, your destination is Veridion Prime, a hostile frontier world rich in Pentoxyd crystals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pentoxyd is the backbone of interstellar civilization. These volatile crystals power faster than light travel, deep space reactors, and advanced military tech. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entire empires rise and fall on Pentoxyd supply, and Veridion Prime is one of the last untapped sources left. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mining it is dangerous, deadly, and cheap only if the workers are prisoners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before arrival, disaster strikes. A massive explosion tears through the inmate transport ship. Alarms scream. Hulls rupture. In the chaos, you escape in a damaged pod and crash onto the surface of Veridion Prime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The planet is unstable, scarred by abandoned mining operations, hostile creatures, and the lingering presence of corporations that value crystals more than lives. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Mining is no longer just labor, it is survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build. Craft. Defend yourself. Explore forgotten facilities and uncover what really happened on Veridion Prime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were sent here to work until death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VERIDION PRIME – A FULLY PROCEDURAL WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every world is freshly generated: unique biomes, dynamic weather, abandoned structures, dangerous wildlife, UNC ruins, and shifting resources.<br>No run will ever play the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your base, expand your territory, and adapt before the planet adapts to you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BECOME AN OUTLANDER – FEARED SURVIVORS OF THE WASTES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive long enough and you will eventually <strong>become an Outlander</strong> – a highly dangerous, rogue inmate marked by UNC as a high-threat fugitive.<br>Outlanders are feared survivors who raid supply lines, attack outposts, and dominate the wild zones.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt or eliminate rival Outlanders to <strong>gain trust and reputation</strong> among colonists and traders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reputation unlocks merchants, missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware: becoming an Outlander also paints a target on your back.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BASE ATTACKS – STARTING AT LEVEL 10</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At level 10, UNC begins sending strike forces to eradicate your settlement.<br><strong>Base attacks start in waves</strong>, escalating every 5 levels.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extend the attack timer by paying taxes at the Trading Center</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock <strong>Defense Turrets</strong> at level 15</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage turret ammo via the <strong>Defense Turret Controller</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build strong, prepare your defenses, and hold the line.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COOPERATIVE STEAM MULTIPLAYER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends through Steam and survive together.<br>Share roles, build massive bases, explore dangerous zones, and defend each other against UNC forces and hostile wildlife.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEDICATED SERVERS – COMING LATER IN DEVELOPMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game evolves, <strong>dedicated server support</strong> will be introduced.<br>Persistent worlds. Large communities. 24/7 survival environments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong></strong><br><strong></strong><br><br><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully procedural maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harsh survival &amp; exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complex base-building</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base attacks starting at level 10</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced AI UNC soldiers &amp; native creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt Outlanders for <strong>trust and reputation</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam co-op for 2–8 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting, weapons, gear, technology</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather &amp; persistent progression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive. Build. Hunt. Become an Outlander.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Outlanders is a sci-fi open-world survival game set on Veridion Prime. Build your base, fight hostile factions, explore alien biomes, craft advanced gear, and survive deadly environmental threats in a living world shaped by your choices.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199480/590371161861eae68b351d12c81a8d7a707e0b78/header.jpg?t=1778241162", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199480/05edb12d51d5256bbca160162ce35078914e1c6d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778241162", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199480/05edb12d51d5256bbca160162ce35078914e1c6d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778241162", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i5-7400 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB 